    {
      "ayah_number": 3,
      "text_tajweed_html": "إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا جَعَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ قُرْء<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>نًا عَرَبِي<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ًّا ل</tajweed>َّعَلَّكُمْ تَعْقِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣</span>"
