      "text_tajweed_html": "فَأَهْلَكْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَشَدَّ مِنْه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>شًا و</tajweed>َمَضَىٰ مَثَلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَوَّل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨</span>"
